[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1263.75, "timestamp": "00:21:03", "text": "某种魂系游戏之类的东西。嗯，他们是怎么做到的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1266.35, "timestamp": "00:21:06", "text": "看？对，没错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1269.83, "timestamp": "00:21:09", "text": "是的，兄弟。他的头肯定像"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1272.887, "timestamp": "00:21:12", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "no not from a game"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1273.19, "timestamp": "00:21:13", "text": "就像完全被浇灭了一样，你知道吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1275.99, "timestamp": "00:21:15", "text": "从上往下。就像应该有一个"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1276.281, "timestamp": "00:21:16", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "thats from real life"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1278.23, "timestamp": "00:21:18", "text": "他头上的凹痕看起来像是透明的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1280.363, "timestamp": "00:21:20", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "medieval stuff"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1281.909, "timestamp": "00:21:21", "text": "那玩意儿。我不想玩这个游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1284.149, "timestamp": "00:21:24", "text": "我的头很大。所以它装不上。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1300.428, "timestamp": "00:21:40", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "its called a frog mouth helm or jousting helm"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1301.39, "timestamp": "00:21:41", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1304.669, "timestamp": "00:21:44", "text": "你喜欢中世纪的东西吗？上帝"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1308.71, "timestamp": "00:21:48", "text": "该死。那个人怎么可能没有"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1311.542, "timestamp": "00:21:51", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "from the 1400s"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1311.59, "timestamp": "00:21:51", "text": "脖子或顶部没有类似的比例"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1316.35, "timestamp": "00:21:56", "text": "头？让我告诉你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1318.11, "timestamp": "00:21:58", "text": "弗罗格莫尔。"}]